<view class="page">
  <view class="contact-hero card">
    <text class="h1">联系 GeoGi 顾问</text>
    <text class="lead">需要确认诊断范围、交付周期或补充品牌资料，可以通过企业微信与 GeoGi 顾问沟通。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section info-card card">
    <text class="info-title">企业微信</text>
    <image
      class="wecom-qr"
      src="{{wecomQr}}"
      mode="aspectFit"
      show-menu-by-longpress="true"
    ></image>
    <text class="info-hint">长按二维码识别并添加 GeoGi 企业微信。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section info-card card">
    <text class="info-title">邮箱</text>
    <text class="info-copy">{{email}}</text>
    <button class="secondary-button copy-button" bindtap="copyEmail">复制邮箱</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section info-card card">
    <text class="info-title">官方网站</text>
    <text class="info-copy">{{website}}</text>
    <button class="secondary-button copy-button" bindtap="copyWebsite">复制官网地址</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section info-card card">
    <text class="info-title">准备开始品牌诊断？</text>
    <text class="info-hint action-hint">填写品牌基础资料后，GeoGi 将进入诊断流程。</text>
    <button class="primary-button copy-button" bindtap="goDiagnosis">提交品牌诊断资料</button>
  </view>
</view>
